            </note>
            <note corresp="#d814-f2" n="12" xml:id="d814-f2-content">
                <p>See memorandum by the Chief of the Division of Southeast Asian Affairs, May 9,
                    and annex thereto, <ref target="#pg994">p. 994</ref>.</p>
            </note>
